---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Education — Fusionedge">
<div class="cs">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Public+Sans:ital,wght@0,400..700;1,400..700&display=swap">

  <!-- Hero -->
  <div class="cs-w">
    <div class="ed-hero">
      <div>
        <span class="cs-tag">Education</span>
        <h1><span class="ed-l">Every classroom ready</span> <span class="ed-l">before <span class="cs-ul">the first bell rings.</span></span></h1>
        <p class="cs-lead">Schools, colleges and universities run on buildings that students never think about: classrooms, labs, hostels, canteens, buses and sports grounds. FusionEdge keeps the whole campus safe, clean and ready, every day of the academic year.</p>
        <div class="cs-btns">
          <a class="cs-btn cs-p" href="https://fusionedge.io/request-demo/">Book a Demo <span class="cs-ar">→</span></a>
          <a class="cs-btn" href="https://fusionedge.io/contact/">Talk to Sales</a>
        </div>
        <div class="ed-trust"><span>All 26 apps in one plan</span><span>One or many campuses</span><span>Web, mobile and QR</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="ed-app" role="img" aria-label="Illustration of a classroom readiness board">
        <div class="ed-bar"><div class="ed-dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><span class="ed-crumb">Campus <i>/</i> <b>Room readiness</b></span><span class="ed-date">Today ▾</span></div>
        <div class="ed-body">
          <div class="ed-sum"><div><small>Rooms ready</small><b>46<span>/48</span></b></div><div><small>Open tickets</small><b>2</b></div><div><small>Cleaning done</small><b>97%</b></div></div>
          <div class="ed-rooms">
            <div class="ed-rh"><span>Time</span><span>Room</span><span>AV</span><span>AC</span><span>Clean</span><span>Status</span></div>
            <div class="ed-r"><time>08:30</time><div><b>Lecture Hall 2</b><small>Block A · 120 seats</small></div><span class="ed-c y">✓</span><span class="ed-c y">✓</span><span class="ed-c y">✓</span><i class="ed-st g">Ready</i></div><div class="ed-r"><time>09:00</time><div><b>Chemistry Lab</b><small>Block C · fume hoods</small></div><span class="ed-c y">✓</span><span class="ed-c p">!</span><span class="ed-c y">✓</span><i class="ed-st a">Check due</i></div><div class="ed-r"><time>10:00</time><div><b>Classroom 3B</b><small>Block B · 40 seats</small></div><span class="ed-c n">✕</span><span class="ed-c y">✓</span><span class="ed-c y">✓</span><i class="ed-st r">AC ticket</i></div><div class="ed-r"><time>11:00</time><div><b>Auditorium</b><small>Main block · 600 seats</small></div><span class="ed-c y">✓</span><span class="ed-c y">✓</span><span class="ed-c y">✓</span><i class="ed-st g">Ready</i></div>
          </div>
          <div class="ed-qr"><span class="q"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7"/><path d="M14 14h3v3h-3zM20 20h1M17 20h1M20 17h1"/></svg></span><div><b>Classroom 3B · AC not cooling</b><span>Reported by a teacher via QR · technician assigned</span></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Campus types -->
  <div class="cs-w">
    <section>
      <div class="cs-head">
        <div><span class="cs-tag">Who it’s for</span><h2>One platform for every kind of campus</h2></div>
        <p class="cs-lead">From a single school to a university with dozens of buildings, the platform fits the way your campus works.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ed-types">
        <article class="ed-t"><span class="ed-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 21V10l9-6 9 6v11"/><path d="M9 21v-6h6v6"/></svg></span><h3>Schools</h3><p>Classrooms, buses, playgrounds and parent visits, kept safe and on schedule.</p></article>
        <article class="ed-t"><span class="ed-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 10L12 5 2 10l10 5 10-5z"/><path d="M6 12v5c3 2 9 2 12 0v-5"/></svg></span><h3>Colleges and universities</h3><p>Many blocks, labs and departments, managed from one estates team.</p></article>
        <article class="ed-t"><span class="ed-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="12" rx="2"/><path d="M8 20h8M12 16v4"/></svg></span><h3>Training centres</h3><p>Rooms and equipment ready for every batch, across every centre.</p></article>
        <article class="ed-t"><span class="ed-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 20V8l9-4 9 4v12"/><path d="M3 14h18M9 20v-6M15 20v-6"/></svg></span><h3>Hostels and residences</h3><p>Room requests, mess hygiene and night-time safety, handled fast.</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <!-- Academic year -->
  <div class="cs-tint">
    <div class="cs-w">
      <div class="cs-head">
        <div><span class="cs-tag">The academic year</span><h2>Ready for every part of the year</h2></div>
        <p class="cs-lead">Each season brings different pressure on the campus. FusionEdge plans for all of them.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ed-year">
        <article class="ed-y"><span class="m">Term start</span><h3>Back to class</h3><p>Every room, lab and hostel checked before students arrive.</p><ul><li>Room readiness checklists</li><li>Asset audits</li></ul></article>
        <article class="ed-y"><span class="m">During term</span><h3>Day-to-day running</h3><p>Requests from staff and students closed fast, with cleaning on schedule.</p><ul><li>QR issue reporting</li><li>Housekeeping rounds</li></ul></article>
        <article class="ed-y"><span class="m">Exams</span><h3>Zero disruptions</h3><p>Exam halls, power backup and AC checked ahead of every paper.</p><ul><li>DG and UPS readiness</li><li>Priority tickets</li></ul></article>
        <article class="ed-y"><span class="m">Breaks</span><h3>Catch up on PPM</h3><p>Major maintenance and repairs done while the campus is quiet.</p><ul><li>PPM scheduling</li><li>Vendor work orders</li></ul></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- People -->
  <div class="cs-w">
    <section class="ed-people">
      <div class="ed-people-side">
        <span class="cs-tag">Everyone on campus</span>
        <h2>The right view for each person</h2>
        <p class="cs-lead">Leaders see the big picture, the estates team gets the work done, and everyone else can report a problem in seconds.</p>
      </div>
      <ul class="ed-plist">
        <li><span class="ed-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><path d="M7 15l4-4 3 3 5-6"/></svg></span><div><h3>Principals and directors</h3><p>One dashboard for every building, with open issues, SLAs and costs at a glance.</p></div></li>
        <li><span class="ed-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14.7 6.3a4 4 0 0 0-5.4 5.4L3 18l3 3 6.3-6.3a4 4 0 0 0 5.4-5.4l-2.5 2.5-2.4-.6-.6-2.4z"/></svg></span><div><h3>Estates and facility teams</h3><p>Work orders, PPM and checklists on their phones, closed with a photo as proof.</p></div></li>
        <li><span class="ed-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"/><path d="M4 21a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"/></svg></span><div><h3>Teachers and staff</h3><p>Scan a QR code in any room to report a fault, book a room or request support.</p></div></li>
        <li><span class="ed-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="4"/><path d="M2 21a7 7 0 0 1 14 0"/><path d="M17 11l2 2 4-4"/></svg></span><div><h3>Parents and visitors</h3><p>Pre-registered passes and a full log of who came in, when and to meet whom.</p></div></li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </div>

  <!-- Safety band -->
  <div class="ed-safe">
    <div class="cs-w">
      <span class="cs-tag">Safety first</span>
      <h2>A safer campus for every student</h2>
      <div class="ed-sg">
        <div><b>Visitor control</b><p>Every visitor, vendor and parent pre-registered and logged at the gate.</p></div>
        <div><b>Fire and life safety</b><p>Extinguishers, alarms and drills tracked with due dates and proof.</p></div>
        <div><b>Hygiene you can show</b><p>Washroom and canteen rounds logged with a photo and time stamp.</p></div>
        <div><b>Incident reporting</b><p>Anyone can report a hazard by QR, and the right person is alerted at once.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <div class="cs-w">
    <div class="cs-cta">
      <span class="cs-tag" style="color:#e6d6ee">Get Started</span>
      <h2 style="margin-top:14px;max-width:24ch">See FusionEdge running on a campus like yours</h2>
      <p>Book a demo and we will walk you through the modules for your classrooms, labs, hostels and gates. No card and no setup fee.</p>
      <div class="cs-btns">
        <a class="cs-btn cs-g" href="https://fusionedge.io/request-demo/">Book a Demo <span class="cs-ar">→</span></a>
        <a class="cs-btn" href="https://fusionedge.io/contact/">Contact Sales</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</Layout>

<style>
.cs{
  --bg:#fff;--soft:#f4eff7;--ink:#1b1530;--mut:#6c6780;--line:#ebe6f0;--card:#fff;
  --brand:#5D1F72;--green:#00BF88;--green-ink:#00a576;--ph:#ece7f0;--phx:#9a91a6;
  --r:16px;--sec:clamp(72px,10vw,120px);color-scheme:light
}
.cs,.cs *{box-sizing:border-box}
.cs{background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:"Public Sans",sans-serif;line-height:1.6;width:100%}
.cs,.cs *,.cs *::before,.cs *::after{font-family:"Public Sans",sans-serif!important}
.cs h1,.cs h2,.cs h3,.cs p{margin:0}
.cs h1,.cs h2,.cs h3{color:var(--ink)}
.cs-w{max-width:1160px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(20px,4vw,40px)}

/* Type — italic display headings like the main site */
.cs h1{font-size:clamp(28px,5.2vw,60px);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.03em;font-weight:600;font-style:italic}
.cs h2{font-size:clamp(26px,3.2vw,38px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-.025em;font-weight:600;font-style:italic;text-wrap:balance}
.cs h3{font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:600;color:var(--brand)}
.cs-lead{font-size:clamp(15px,1.4vw,17px);color:var(--mut);line-height:1.7}
.cs-ul{color:var(--brand);text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:var(--green);text-decoration-thickness:3px;text-underline-offset:8px}

/* Bits */
.cs-tag{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brand)}
.cs-tag::before{content:"";width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:currentColor}
.cs-pill{font-size:12.5px;padding:5px 12px;border-radius:99px;background:#fff;color:var(--brand);border:1px solid #dccde6}
.cs-btns{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.cs-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;padding:13px 26px;border-radius:99px;font:600 14px/1 "Public Sans",sans-serif;
  border:1px solid #d9cfe2;background:#fff;color:var(--brand);text-decoration:none;transition:transform .15s,background .15s,border-color .15s,box-shadow .15s}
.cs-btn:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);border-color:var(--brand)}
.cs-btn.cs-p,.cs-btn.cs-g{background:var(--brand);color:#fff;border-color:var(--brand)}
.cs-btn.cs-p:hover,.cs-btn.cs-g:hover{box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(93,31,114,.25)}
.cs-btn .cs-ar{transition:transform .15s}.cs-btn:hover .cs-ar{transform:translateX(3px)}

.cs-ph{background:var(--ph);color:var(--phx);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;border-radius:var(--r);overflow:hidden}
.cs-ph::before{content:"Image"}

/* Hero */
.cs-hero{padding:clamp(56px,8vw,104px) 0 0;text-align:center}
.cs-hero h1{margin:0 auto;white-space:nowrap}
.cs-hero .cs-sub{font-size:clamp(15px,2.2vw,21px);font-weight:600;font-style:italic;margin:18px auto 0;white-space:nowrap}
.cs-hero .cs-lead{max-width:780px;margin:16px auto 32px;text-wrap:balance}
.cs-hero .cs-btns{justify-content:center}
.cs-checks{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:40px auto 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px;max-width:1040px;text-align:left}
.cs-checks li{display:flex;gap:10px;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.45;color:var(--ink);padding:16px;border-radius:14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(93,31,114,.05)}
.cs-checks li::before{content:"✓";flex:none;width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--green);color:#fff;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;display:grid;place-items:center}
.cs-hero-img{aspect-ratio:16/7;margin-top:clamp(40px,6vw,64px);border-radius:24px}
@media (max-width:640px){.cs-hero .cs-sub{white-space:normal;max-width:30ch}}
@media (max-width:480px){.cs-hero h1{white-space:normal;max-width:12ch}}

/* Stats */
.cs-stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));margin:clamp(48px,7vw,80px) 0 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.cs-stats div{padding:28px clamp(16px,2.5vw,32px)}
.cs-stats div+div{border-left:1px solid var(--line)}
.cs-stats b{display:block;font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,48px);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.03em;line-height:1;color:var(--green-ink)}
.cs-stats span{display:block;font-size:14px;color:var(--mut);margin-top:10px}

/* Sections */
.cs section{margin-top:var(--sec)}
.cs-head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:clamp(20px,5vw,80px);align-items:end;margin-bottom:clamp(32px,4vw,48px)}
.cs-head h2{margin-top:14px}

.cs-grid3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:clamp(16px,2vw,24px)}
.cs-grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:clamp(16px,2vw,24px)}
.cs-card{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r);overflow:hidden;background:var(--card);display:flex;flex-direction:column;
  box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(93,31,114,.06);transition:transform .2s,box-shadow .2s}
.cs-card:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 16px 36px rgba(93,31,114,.12)}
.cs-card .cs-ph{border-radius:0;aspect-ratio:16/10}
.cs-grid2 .cs-card .cs-ph{aspect-ratio:16/8}
.cs-card .cs-b{padding:22px 22px 24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
.cs-card p{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--mut);line-height:1.65}
.cs-card .cs-n{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--green-ink);letter-spacing:.04em}

/* Purple band */
.cs-band{margin-top:var(--sec);background:var(--brand);color:#fff;padding:clamp(56px,8vw,96px) 0;text-align:center}
.cs-band h2{color:#fff}
.cs-band p{margin:14px auto 0;max-width:640px;font-size:clamp(15px,1.5vw,17px);color:#e6d6ee}

/* Feature rows */
.cs-feat{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.05fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:clamp(32px,6vw,88px);align-items:center}
.cs-feat.cs-rev{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1.05fr)}
.cs-feat.cs-rev .cs-ph{order:2}
.cs-feat .cs-ph{aspect-ratio:5/4;border-radius:24px}
.cs-feat .cs-t{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px;align-items:flex-start}
.cs-feat .cs-t p{font-size:15.5px;color:var(--mut);line-height:1.75}
.cs-tags{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:6px}
.cs-chips{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;width:100%;max-width:420px;margin-top:6px}
.cs-chip{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px 18px;font-size:13px;color:var(--mut);background:#fff;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(93,31,114,.05)}
.cs-chip b{display:block;font-size:20px;color:var(--green-ink);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin-bottom:2px}

/* Lavender section */
.cs-tint{background:var(--soft);margin-top:var(--sec);padding:var(--sec) 0}
.cs-tint section{margin-top:0}

/* CTA */
.cs-cta{margin:var(--sec) 0 clamp(56px,8vw,96px);background:var(--brand);color:#fff;border-radius:24px;text-align:center;
  padding:clamp(56px,8vw,88px) clamp(20px,4vw,48px)}
.cs-cta h2{max-width:20ch;margin:0 auto;color:#fff}
.cs-cta p{max-width:560px;margin:16px auto 32px;font-size:clamp(15px,1.5vw,17px);color:#e6d6ee}
.cs-cta .cs-btns{justify-content:center}
.cs-cta .cs-btn.cs-g{background:#fff;color:var(--brand);border-color:#fff}
.cs-cta .cs-btn:not(.cs-g){background:transparent;color:#fff;border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.4)}
.cs-cta .cs-btn:not(.cs-g):hover{border-color:#fff}

/* Responsive */
@media (max-width:960px){.cs-checks{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.cs-grid3{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
@media (max-width:760px){
  .cs-stats{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
  .cs-stats div:nth-child(3){border-left:0}
  .cs-stats div:nth-child(n+3){border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
  .cs-head{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:14px}
  .cs-feat,.cs-feat.cs-rev{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:28px}
  .cs-feat.cs-rev .cs-ph{order:0}
  .cs-hero-img{aspect-ratio:4/3}
}
@media (max-width:560px){.cs-checks,.cs-grid3,.cs-grid2{grid-template-columns:1fr}.cs-btns .cs-btn{flex:1 1 auto}}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.cs *{transition:none!important}}

/* Button colours locked so global link styles can't override them */
.cs a.cs-btn,.cs a.cs-btn:visited{color:var(--brand)!important;text-decoration:none!important}
.cs a.cs-btn.cs-p,.cs a.cs-btn.cs-p:visited,.cs a.cs-btn.cs-p:hover,
.cs a.cs-btn.cs-g,.cs a.cs-btn.cs-g:visited,.cs a.cs-btn.cs-g:hover{color:#fff!important}
.cs .cs-cta a.cs-btn.cs-g,.cs .cs-cta a.cs-btn.cs-g:visited,.cs .cs-cta a.cs-btn.cs-g:hover{color:var(--brand)!important}
.cs .cs-cta a.cs-btn:not(.cs-g),.cs .cs-cta a.cs-btn:not(.cs-g):visited{color:#fff!important}

/* Extra responsive polish */
.cs img,.cs svg{max-width:100%}
.cs{overflow-x:clip}
@media (max-width:760px){
  .cs-hero{padding-top:48px}
  .cs-checks{margin-top:28px}
  .cs-card .cs-b{padding:18px}
  .cs-feat .cs-t p{font-size:15px}
  .cs-chips{max-width:none}
}
@media (max-width:560px){
  .cs-btns{flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;width:100%;max-width:360px;margin:0 auto}
  .cs-feat .cs-t .cs-btns{margin:0}
  .cs-btn{width:100%}
  .cs-stats b{font-size:32px}
  .cs-stats div{padding:20px 14px}
  .cs-hero-img,.cs-feat .cs-ph{border-radius:16px}
  .cs-cta{border-radius:18px}
}
@media (max-width:360px){
  .cs-stats{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .cs-stats div{border-left:0!important}
  .cs-stats div+div{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
  .cs-chips{grid-template-columns:1fr}
}



/* ===== Education additions ===== */
.ed-hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.05fr) minmax(0,.95fr);gap:clamp(28px,4vw,56px);align-items:center;padding:clamp(48px,7vw,96px) 0 0}
.cs .ed-hero h1{font-size:clamp(26px,2.9vw,38px);line-height:1.15;margin:16px 0 0}
.ed-l{display:block;white-space:nowrap}
.ed-hero .cs-lead{margin:20px 0 30px;max-width:560px}
.ed-trust{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 18px;margin-top:28px;font-size:13px;color:var(--mut)}
.ed-trust span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.ed-trust span::before{content:"✓";width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--green);color:#fff;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;display:grid;place-items:center}

/* Readiness board */
.ed-app{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e6e0ec;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(27,21,48,.04),0 24px 60px -12px rgba(93,31,114,.18);overflow:hidden;font-size:12px}
.ed-bar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #efeaf3;background:#fbfafc}
.ed-dots{display:flex;gap:5px}.ed-dots i{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#e2dce8}
.ed-crumb{flex:1;font-size:12px;color:var(--mut)}.ed-crumb i{font-style:normal;margin:0 4px;color:#c9c2d3}.ed-crumb b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}
.ed-date{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink);border:1px solid #e6e0ec;border-radius:6px;padding:3px 8px;background:#fff}
